{"title": "Hypnotic Gaze (Condition)", "pageid": 20014, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hypnotic_Gaze_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hypnotic Gaze Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Hypnotic_Gaze_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Hypnotic Gaze</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Can't move or take actions, bonus actions, or reactions.</li>\n<li>Spellcaster has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"